# A repeater in a west-to-east wire. It restores the signal to full strength and
# adds its delay: 2 game ticks per setting. The build sets the setting (1 to 4);
# the file shows setting 1. The tile is placed rotated for other directions.
tile repeater
size 5 4 5
port W in 0 1 2
port E out 4 1 2
function repeater
delay 2

legend
  G minecraft:glass
  > minecraft:repeater[facing=west,delay=1]
  - minecraft:redstone_wire

layer 0
  .....
  .....
  GGGGG
  .....
  .....
layer 1
  .....
  .....
  ->---
  .....
  .....
